WEBVTT

00:09.137 --> 00:10.620
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.965 --> 00:12.000
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.241 --> 00:14.034
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.137 --> 00:15.413
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.689 --> 00:18.103
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:18.482 --> 00:20.241
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.482 --> 00:22.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.793 --> 00:24.724
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:24.965 --> 00:26.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.586 --> 00:28.506
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.758 --> 00:30.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.517 --> 00:32.551
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.793 --> 00:34.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.655 --> 00:36.206
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.482 --> 00:39.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:39.482 --> 00:40.793
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:41.172 --> 00:42.965
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

