00:49.068 --> 00:50.275
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:08.241 --> 01:09.344
Hi, mailman!
嗨，邮递员！

01:10.862 --> 01:12.103
Okay, see you tomorrow.
好的，明天见。

01:12.379 --> 01:13.586
Hey, the mail's here.
嘿，邮件来了。

01:13.862 --> 01:15.068
What did you get?
你得到了什么？

01:15.344 --> 01:16.689
Let's see...
让我们来看看...

01:16.793 --> 01:18.233
Gary, Gary, Gary,
Gary, Gary, Gary...
加里，加里，加里，
加里，加里，加里……

01:18.482 --> 01:19.758
Hey, a magazine!
嘿，一本杂志！

01:20.034 --> 01:21.689
That's funny, I don't remember
很好笑，我不记得了

01:22.068 --> 01:24.206
subscribing to
Fancy Living Digest.
订阅
花式生活文摘。

01:24.448 --> 01:26.379
Whoa!
哇！

01:26.793 --> 01:28.655
Look at these glossy depictions
看看这些光鲜亮丽的描绘

01:28.758 --> 01:30.517
of a higher standard of living.
更高的生活水平。

01:30.793 --> 01:32.482
This guy's so rich
这家伙真有钱

01:32.827 --> 01:34.620
he has a swimming pool
in his swimming pool.
他有一个游泳池
在他的游泳池里。

01:34.724 --> 01:36.448
This guy's got shoes!
这家伙有鞋！

01:36.724 --> 01:37.724
Give me that!
给我那个！

01:37.896 --> 01:39.965
Stealing my mail, eh?
偷我的邮件，嗯？

01:40.068 --> 01:42.028
You're lucky
I don't report you
to the authorities!
你很幸运
我不举报你
给当局！

01:42.172 --> 01:43.517
Hey, Squidward,
嘿，章鱼哥，

01:43.620 --> 01:45.758
how do those people
get all that money?
那些人怎么样
得到所有这些钱吗？

01:45.862 --> 01:48.620
They're entrepreneurs...
They sell things to people.
他们是企业家...
他们向人们出售东西。

01:48.724 --> 01:50.103
What kind of things?
什么样的事情？

01:50.379 --> 01:51.586
How should I know?
我怎么知道？

01:51.827 --> 01:53.517
Things people want to buy!
人们想买的东西！

01:53.827 --> 01:54.838
Now, keep your paws off my mail.
现在，别碰我的邮件。

01:54.862 --> 01:56.275
That's it, Patrick!
就是这样，帕特里克！

01:56.379 --> 01:57.620
We got to become entrepreneurs!
我们必须成为企业家！

01:57.724 --> 01:59.517
Is that gonna hurt?
那会疼吗？

01:59.758 --> 02:01.206
Quick, if you
could have anything
快点，如果你
可以有任何东西

02:01.689 --> 02:03.689
in the world right now,
what would it be?
在现在的世界上，
会是什么？

02:04.000 --> 02:06.103
Uh... more time for thinking!
呃……还有时间思考！

02:06.517 --> 02:10.241
No, something real, an item,
something you would pay for.
不，是真实的东西，一个物品，
你愿意付出代价的东西。

02:10.517 --> 02:11.620
A chocolate bar?
一块巧克力？

02:11.724 --> 02:13.482
That's a great idea, Pat!
这是个好主意，帕特！

02:13.827 --> 02:15.862
We'll be traveling
chocolate bar salesmen.
我们将去旅行
巧克力棒推销员。

02:16.758 --> 02:18.172
Fancy living...
美好的生活...

02:18.448 --> 02:19.965
here we come!
我们来了！

02:20.275 --> 02:22.620
Make way for a couple
of "entrepe-nooers"!
给情侣让路
“entrepe-nooers”！

02:22.965 --> 02:24.793
Okay, Patrick, this is it,
好吧，帕特里克，就是这样，

02:24.896 --> 02:27.551
the first step on our
road to living fancy.
我们的第一步
通往幻想生活的道路。

02:27.793 --> 02:29.206
Just follow my lead.
只要跟随我的引导即可。

02:30.586 --> 02:32.241
Good afternoon, sir.
下午好，先生。

02:32.344 --> 02:35.241
Could we interest you
in some chocolate?
我们能让您感兴趣吗
一些巧克力？

02:35.517 --> 02:36.724
Chocolate?
巧克力？

02:36.827 --> 02:39.379
Did you say "chocolate"?
你说“巧克力”吗？

02:39.620 --> 02:40.827
Yes, sir!
是的，先生！

02:40.931 --> 02:42.000
With or without nuts?
带或不带坚果？

02:42.275 --> 02:43.482
Chocolate?
巧克力？

02:43.758 --> 02:45.310
Chocolate?!
巧克力？！

02:45.413 --> 02:47.482
Chocolate!
巧克力！

02:47.758 --> 02:50.000
Chocolate!
巧克力！

02:50.275 --> 02:51.275
Chocolate!
巧克力！

02:51.517 --> 02:53.241
Chocolate!
巧克力！

02:53.620 --> 02:55.206
Okay, that first guy
didn't count.
好吧，第一个人
没有算。

02:55.448 --> 02:57.275
This is our real first step.
这是我们真正的第一步。

02:57.551 --> 02:59.034
Good morning, sir.
早上好，先生。

02:59.137 --> 03:00.689
Would you like to buy
some chocolate?
你想买吗
一些巧克力？

03:00.793 --> 03:02.620
Chocolate bars, eh?
巧克力棒，嗯？

03:02.931 --> 03:05.241
Yes, sir, we are
chocolate bar salesmen.
是的，先生，我们是
巧克力棒推销员。

03:05.344 --> 03:07.655
A couple a mediocre salesmen,
if you ask me.
一对平庸的推销员夫妇，
如果你问我。

03:07.965 --> 03:10.448
That's no way to carry
your merchandise.
那是没办法携带的
你的商品。

03:11.000 --> 03:12.724
No, no, no, wrong.
不不不，错了。

03:12.827 --> 03:15.413
You guys want to be
goodsalesmen, right?
你们想成为
好的推销员，对吗？

03:15.724 --> 03:17.517
Oh, most certainly sir!
噢，当然是先生！

03:17.827 --> 03:20.034
Well, no self-respecting
candy bar salesman
嗯，没有自尊心
棒棒糖推销员

03:20.379 --> 03:23.551
would be caught dead
without one of these!
会被抓死
没有其中之一！

03:23.793 --> 03:25.551
Wow... what is it?
哇……这是什么？

03:25.896 --> 03:28.344
It's a candy bar bag,
you knucklehead!
这是一个糖果袋，
你这个笨蛋！

03:28.620 --> 03:29.758
It's specially designed
它是专门设计的

03:30.034 --> 03:31.586
to cradle each candy bar
支撑每块棒棒糖

03:31.827 --> 03:33.172
in velvet-lined comfort.
天鹅绒衬里的舒适感。

03:33.448 --> 03:34.482
But...
但...

03:34.586 --> 03:35.655
I'm wasting my time.
我在浪费时间。

03:35.965 --> 03:37.586
You don't need these bags.
你不需要这些袋子。

03:37.827 --> 03:39.793
We need them!
We need them!
我们需要他们！
我们需要他们！

03:42.896 --> 03:43.965
So long, boys!
再见，孩子们！

03:44.241 --> 03:45.413
Happy hunting!
狩猎快乐！

03:47.655 --> 03:49.275
Suckers!
傻瓜！

03:49.379 --> 03:52.379
♪ Fancy living, here we come
♪ 美好生活，我们来了

03:52.620 --> 03:54.758
♪ La-la, la-la, la... ♪
♪ 啦啦，啦啦，啦……♪

03:55.103 --> 03:57.965
Let's try next door.
我们去隔壁试试吧

04:00.344 --> 04:01.344
Yes?
是的？

04:01.482 --> 04:02.724
Huh?
啊？

04:02.827 --> 04:04.172
Say, weren't you the same guy
说吧，你们不是同一个人吗？

04:04.275 --> 04:05.555
who sold us these
candy bar bags?
谁卖给我们这些
糖果袋？

04:05.655 --> 04:07.310
I... don't recall.
我……不记得了。

04:07.551 --> 04:09.172
But it looks to me
但在我看来

04:09.275 --> 04:11.035
like you fellas have got
a lot of bags there.
就像你们一样
那里有很多袋子。

04:11.137 --> 04:13.068
You two lady-killers are
too smart to be
你们两个都是女人杀手
太聪明了

04:13.517 --> 04:17.413
without one of my patented
candy bar bag carrying bags.
没有我的一项专利
糖果袋手提袋。

04:17.689 --> 04:19.034
We'll take 20!
我们要20个！

04:21.137 --> 04:24.379
Oh, what can I do for
you two nice young men?
哦，我能做什么
你们两个好年轻人吗？

04:24.620 --> 04:25.780
We're selling chocolate bars.
我们正在销售巧克力棒。

04:26.034 --> 04:27.344
Like to buy one?
喜欢买一个吗？

04:27.448 --> 04:29.344
That sounds heavenly.
这听起来很美妙。

04:29.586 --> 04:30.931
I'll take one.
我要一份。

04:31.034 --> 04:32.827
One chocolate bar coming up!
一根巧克力棒来了！

04:35.137 --> 04:36.137
Huh?
啊？

04:37.448 --> 04:38.620
Eh...
呃……

04:38.896 --> 04:40.068
Huh?
啊？

04:42.793 --> 04:43.862
Huh?
啊？

04:43.965 --> 04:46.137
Uh, uh, uh...
呃呃呃……

04:53.000 --> 04:54.862
I know they're
in here somewhere!
我知道他们是
就在这里的某个地方！

04:54.965 --> 04:56.310
I don't have time for this.
我没有时间做这个。

04:57.655 --> 04:59.137
I got it!
我得到了它！

04:59.241 --> 05:00.551
One chocolate bar
for the nice...
一根巧克力棒
为了美好的...

05:00.793 --> 05:01.793
Chocolate!
巧克力！

05:01.965 --> 05:02.965
Chocolate!
巧克力！

05:03.034 --> 05:04.137
Chocolate!
巧克力！

05:04.413 --> 05:06.241
Chocolate!
巧克力！

05:07.517 --> 05:08.631
We're not doing
so well, Patrick.
我们不做
很好，帕特里克。

05:08.655 --> 05:09.655
We need a new approach...
我们需要一种新方法......

05:10.000 --> 05:11.000
a new tactic!
新战术！

05:11.241 --> 05:12.551
Huh...
呃……

05:12.655 --> 05:14.137
I got it... let's get naked!
我明白了...让我们裸体吧！

05:14.241 --> 05:16.401
No, let's save that for when
we're selling real estate.
不，让我们把它留到什么时候
我们正在出售房地产。

05:16.551 --> 05:18.000
There must be something!
一定有什么东西！

05:18.103 --> 05:19.703
What was the reason
we bought those bags?
原因是什么
我们买了那些包？

05:19.896 --> 05:21.551
He said we were mediocre.
他说我们很平庸。

05:21.862 --> 05:23.724
That's it...
He made us feel special.
就是这样...
他让我们感觉很特别。

05:24.000 --> 05:25.551
Yeah, he did.
是的，他做到了。

05:25.655 --> 05:26.935
I'm going back to buy more bags!
我要回去买更多包包了！

05:26.965 --> 05:27.965
No, wait, Patrick!
不，等等，帕特里克！

05:29.724 --> 05:31.379
Why don't we try being nice?
我们为什么不试着表现得友善一些呢？

05:31.620 --> 05:33.551
Oh... okay.
哦好的。

05:33.896 --> 05:36.241
Remember, Patrick,
flatter the customer.
请记住，帕特里克，
奉承顾客。

05:36.517 --> 05:38.068
Make him feel good.
让他感觉良好。

05:39.000 --> 05:40.000
Hello?
你好？

05:40.103 --> 05:41.448
I love you.
我爱你。

05:43.344 --> 05:45.275
You laid it on
a teensy thick
there, old pal.
你把它放在
一点点厚
在那里，老朋友。

05:45.551 --> 05:46.551
Let me try.
让我试试。

05:47.827 --> 05:49.068
Please. Go away!
请。离开！

05:49.310 --> 05:50.896
Um...
嗯...

05:51.000 --> 05:52.586
Uh, uh, how ya doin'?
呃，呃，你好吗？

05:52.862 --> 05:54.068
How am I doing?
我怎么样？

05:54.344 --> 05:55.586
Wanna buy some chocolate?
想买点巧克力吗？

05:55.827 --> 05:56.862
We got him now!
我们现在抓到他了！

05:57.206 --> 05:58.689
Sorry, chocolate has sugar,
抱歉，巧克力有糖，

05:58.931 --> 06:00.211
and sugar turns to bubbling fat.
糖变成冒泡的脂肪。

06:00.310 --> 06:01.965
Isn't that right, lover boy?
不是吗，爱人男孩？

06:02.275 --> 06:04.000
It tickles!
好痒啊！

06:04.448 --> 06:06.182
As you can see,
me and chocolate no longer hang.
正如你所看到的，
我和巧克力不再挂在一起。

06:06.206 --> 06:08.482
You can keep that
for five bucks.
你可以保留那个
五块钱。

06:08.758 --> 06:10.275
I'll take ten!
我要十个！

06:10.379 --> 06:12.034
We haven't sold
one chocolate bar.
我们还没卖
一根巧克力棒。

06:12.482 --> 06:15.206
I have a feeling we're
too easily distracted.
我有一种感觉我们
太容易分心。

06:15.310 --> 06:16.620
Huh?
啊？

06:16.724 --> 06:18.482
Let's make a pact right now
我们现在就立个契约

06:18.586 --> 06:21.137
that we will stay
focused on selling
at the next house.
我们会留下来
专注于销售
在隔壁房子。

06:21.241 --> 06:22.241
What?
什么？

06:22.517 --> 06:23.655
Let's shake on it.
让我们来摇一摇吧。

06:23.931 --> 06:25.241
Did you say something?
你有说什么吗？

06:25.344 --> 06:27.241
Remember, Patrick, focus.
记住，帕特里克，集中注意力。

06:29.344 --> 06:30.517
Yes?
是的？

06:30.620 --> 06:31.931
Good afternoon, sir.
下午好，先生。

06:32.034 --> 06:33.413
We're selling chocolate bars.
我们正在销售巧克力棒。

06:36.310 --> 06:38.068
Why is Chubby here
staring at me?
小胖怎么会在这里
盯着我？

06:38.172 --> 06:40.413
Focusing.
聚焦。

06:42.517 --> 06:43.551
Back up, Jack!
后退，杰克！

06:46.896 --> 06:48.758
Nice place you got here.
你来到这里真是个好地方。

06:49.206 --> 06:52.586
I can't understand
what we're doing wrong.
我不明白
我们做错了什么。

06:52.689 --> 06:54.172
I can't understand anything.
我什么都听不懂。

06:54.551 --> 06:56.793
There must be something
to this selling game
一定有什么
对于这款畅销游戏

06:57.034 --> 06:58.482
that we're just not getting.
我们只是没有得到。

06:58.965 --> 07:00.862
Other people do it,
I mean, look at that!
别人这样做，
我的意思是，看看那个！

07:01.241 --> 07:03.103
"Eat Barnacle Chips,
they're delicious."
“吃藤壶片，
它们很好吃。”

07:03.413 --> 07:05.620
They are most certainly
not delicious!
他们最肯定的是
不好吃！

07:05.896 --> 07:07.517
Not the way I use them.
不是我使用它们的方式。

07:07.620 --> 07:09.379
Yet they sell
millions of bags a day.
然而他们却卖
每天有数百万个袋子。

07:09.758 --> 07:11.518
Well, maybe if they
didn't stretch the truth,
好吧，也许如果他们
没有夸大事实，

07:11.793 --> 07:13.344
they wouldn't sell as many.
他们不会卖那么多。

07:13.586 --> 07:15.068
That's it, Patrick!
就是这样，帕特里克！

07:15.172 --> 07:16.586
We've got to stretch the truth!
我们必须夸大事实！

07:16.827 --> 07:19.068
Chocolate!
巧克力！

07:19.862 --> 07:20.862
We'll work as a team.
我们将作为一个团队工作。

07:21.137 --> 07:22.793
Let me get this customer
warmed up
让我找到这个客户
热身

07:23.068 --> 07:24.931
and then you come in
for the kill.
然后你进来
为了杀戮。

07:25.034 --> 07:26.448
The kill.
杀戮。

07:28.551 --> 07:29.620
Yes?
是的？

07:29.896 --> 07:31.724
Hello, young lady.
你好，年轻的女士。

07:33.344 --> 07:35.000
We're selling chocolate.
我们正在卖巧克力。

07:35.103 --> 07:37.482
Is your mother home?
你妈妈在家吗？

07:37.586 --> 07:39.379
Mom!
妈妈！

07:39.965 --> 07:41.103
What? What?
什么？什么？

07:41.206 --> 07:42.517
What's all that yelling?
这么大喊大叫干什么？

07:43.275 --> 07:44.448
You just can't wait
你只是等不及了

07:44.724 --> 07:46.655
for me to die, can you?
让我去死，你可以吗？

07:47.000 --> 07:48.517
They're selling chocolate.
他们在卖巧克力。

07:48.793 --> 07:50.103
- Chocolate?
- Yeah!
- 巧克力？
- 是的！

07:50.344 --> 07:51.551
What? What are
they selling?
什么？什么是
他们卖？

07:51.827 --> 07:52.965
Chocolates!
巧克力！

07:53.068 --> 07:54.620
What? Chocolates!
什么？巧克力！

07:54.896 --> 07:56.034
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

07:56.137 --> 07:57.586
They're selling chocolates!
他们在卖巧克力！

07:57.827 --> 07:58.867
They're selling chocolate?
他们卖巧克力吗？

07:59.034 --> 08:00.034
Yeah!
是的！

08:00.103 --> 08:02.103
Chocolate?
巧克力？

08:02.206 --> 08:04.724
I remember when they first
invented chocolate.
我记得他们第一次的时候
发明了巧克力。

08:05.000 --> 08:07.551
Sweet, sweet chocolate.
甜甜的，甜甜的巧克力。

08:07.827 --> 08:09.413
I always hated it!
我一直讨厌它！

08:09.758 --> 08:12.241
Oh, but this chocolate's
not for eating.
哦，但是这个巧克力
不是为了吃。

08:12.517 --> 08:13.862
It's for...
这是为了...

08:14.137 --> 08:15.586
You rub it on your skin
你把它擦在你的皮肤上

08:15.862 --> 08:17.206
and it makes you live forever!
它会让你永生！

08:17.482 --> 08:18.931
No, no, no...
不，不，不……

08:19.206 --> 08:20.620
Live forever, you say?
你说永远活下去？

08:20.896 --> 08:22.000
I'll take one.
我要一份。

08:24.241 --> 08:25.827
Come on, you lazy Mary.
来吧，你这个懒惰的玛丽。

08:26.103 --> 08:28.620
Start rubbing me
with that chocolate!
开始揉我
和那块巧克力！

08:28.827 --> 08:31.137
I hate you.
我恨你。

08:31.241 --> 08:33.206
If we keep
exaggerating the truth,
如果我们保留
夸大事实，

08:33.310 --> 08:35.482
we'll be fancy-living
in no time!
我们会过着奢侈的生活
很快！

08:35.724 --> 08:37.862
Hooray for lying!
撒谎万岁！

08:38.206 --> 08:39.862
It'll make your hair grow.
它会让你的头发长起来。

08:40.103 --> 08:41.482
Great!
伟大的！

08:41.586 --> 08:43.000
My wife's trying
to grow a beard.
我的妻子正在努力
留胡子。

08:43.275 --> 08:44.320
It'll make you sound smart.
这会让你听起来很聪明。

08:44.344 --> 08:46.137
I'll take 20!
我要20个！

08:46.517 --> 08:48.896
It'll keep your face
from getting any uglier.
它会保住你的脸
免得变得更丑。

08:49.103 --> 08:50.103
Just in time.
恰逢其时。

08:50.344 --> 08:51.655
They make you fly.
他们让你飞翔。

08:51.931 --> 08:53.206
You'll fall in love.
你会坠入爱河的。

08:53.310 --> 08:54.689
They'll bring world peace!
他们将为世界带来和平！

08:54.931 --> 08:56.103
You'll walk through walls!
你会穿墙而过！

08:56.206 --> 08:57.517
You'll rule the world!
你将统治世界！

09:02.413 --> 09:04.827
This'll be the best lie yet!
这将是最好的谎言！

09:05.103 --> 09:06.482
Yeah!
是的！

09:06.586 --> 09:07.965
This guy will feel
so sorry for us,
这家伙会觉得
真对不起我们，

09:08.068 --> 09:09.655
he'll have to buy
all of our chocolate!
他必须买
我们所有的巧克力！

09:11.000 --> 09:12.517
What can I do for you boys?
我能为你们做什么？

09:12.862 --> 09:14.622
Hello, would you like
to buy a chocolate bar?
你好，你愿意吗
买一块巧克力？

09:14.793 --> 09:15.965
We need an operation.
我们需要进行手术。

09:16.241 --> 09:17.448
Really?
真的吗？

09:17.551 --> 09:18.827
Small world.
小世界。

09:19.068 --> 09:20.448
What's the matter with you guys?
你们怎么了？

09:20.551 --> 09:22.103
Uh...
呃...

09:22.206 --> 09:24.241
We've got some head trauma
and eternal bleeding.
我们头部受了一些外伤
和永恒的流血。

09:24.344 --> 09:26.793
Some guys have all the luck.
有些人拥有所有的运气。

09:27.241 --> 09:30.034
I was born with glass bones
and paper skin.
我生来就有玻璃骨头
和纸皮。

09:30.379 --> 09:32.206
Every morning I break my legs
每天早上我都会摔断腿

09:32.310 --> 09:34.034
and every afternoon
I break my arms.
以及每个下午
我折断双臂。

09:34.310 --> 09:36.241
At night I lie awake in agony
晚上我痛苦地躺在床上无法入睡

09:36.344 --> 09:38.724
until my heart attacks
put me to sleep.
直到我心脏病发作
让我睡觉。

09:38.965 --> 09:39.965
Oh, no!
哦，不！

09:47.379 --> 09:48.517
Ow.
噢。

09:48.620 --> 09:49.860
Quick, Patrick, let's help him.
快点，帕特里克，我们来帮助他。

09:49.931 --> 09:50.931
Careful.
小心。

09:51.172 --> 09:52.172
Put him down gently.
轻轻把他放下。

09:53.517 --> 09:54.551
Ow...
噢...

09:54.827 --> 09:56.344
Poor, poor man.
可怜的，可怜的人。

09:56.448 --> 09:58.206
If there's anything... anything...
如果有什么的话……有什么……

09:58.482 --> 09:59.793
We can do to help you...
我们可以帮您...

10:00.034 --> 10:01.586
There is one thing.
有一件事。

10:01.793 --> 10:03.241
As you can well imagine,
正如你可以想象的那样，

10:03.586 --> 10:05.241
my medical bills
are extremely high,
我的医疗账单
都非常高，

10:05.620 --> 10:07.689
but luckily I'm able
to keep myself alive
但幸运的是我能够
让自己活下去

10:07.931 --> 10:10.896
by selling... chocolate bars.
通过销售……巧克力棒。

10:15.310 --> 10:16.620
Such nice boys.
这么好的男孩。

10:16.896 --> 10:19.000
It does my heart good...
这对我的心脏有好处...

10:19.413 --> 10:23.620
to con a couple of class-A
sucker-roonies like those two!
骗几个A级
就像那两个傻瓜一样！

10:25.965 --> 10:28.758
Don't get me wrong, Patrick,
别误会我的意思，帕特里克，

10:29.000 --> 10:30.758
it's great that
we helped him out,
太好了
我们帮助他，

10:30.862 --> 10:34.586
but there's no one left in town
to sell chocolate bars to.
但镇上已空无一人
出售巧克力棒。

10:34.689 --> 10:35.758
Whoa!
哇！

10:37.655 --> 10:40.620
Let's face it, Patrick,
we're failures.
让我们面对现实吧，帕特里克，
我们是失败者。

10:40.724 --> 10:42.482
I can live with that.
我可以忍受这一点。

10:43.724 --> 10:46.344
Let's change our names
to "Why" and "Bother."
让我们改变我们的名字
到“为什么”和“打扰”。

10:48.000 --> 10:49.896
Chocolate!
巧克力！

10:50.206 --> 10:52.241
No, no, don't
hurt us!
Please...
不，不，不要
伤害我们！
请...

10:56.793 --> 10:58.275
Finally!
最后！

10:58.379 --> 11:01.137
I've been trying to catch
you boys all day!
我一直在努力捕捉
你们这些孩子整天！

11:01.551 --> 11:04.310
Now that I've got you
right where I want you...
现在我有了你
就在我想要你的地方...

11:04.689 --> 11:06.379
I'd like to buy
all your chocolate.
我想买
你所有的巧克力。

11:14.000 --> 11:16.310
Thank you for your patronage.
感谢您的惠顾。

11:16.689 --> 11:19.793
Are we living the fancy life
yet, SpongeBob?
我们过着奢侈的生活吗
然而，海绵宝宝？

11:20.034 --> 11:21.448
Not yet, pally.
还没有，伙计。

11:21.551 --> 11:23.241
First we got to spend
all the money.
首先我们要花
所有的钱。

11:23.344 --> 11:24.931
But what are we going
to spend it on?
但我们要去做什么
花在什么地方？

11:25.206 --> 11:26.827
Hmm...
唔...

11:29.931 --> 11:31.000
Good evening, sir.
晚上好，先生。

11:31.275 --> 11:32.827
Table for one, please.
请一人一桌。

11:32.931 --> 11:34.965
Sorry, but the whole restaurant
has been rented
抱歉，整个餐厅
已被租用

11:35.241 --> 11:36.517
to a private party.
参加私人聚会。

11:36.620 --> 11:38.689
But it's my only night
to be fancy!
但这是我唯一的夜晚
要花哨！

11:39.103 --> 11:41.413
Oh, who could afford to rent out
the whole restaurant?
哦，谁能租得起
整个餐厅？

11:41.862 --> 11:45.068
Oh, a couple of
rich entrepreneurs
and their dates.
哦，有几个
富有的企业家
和他们的日期。

11:45.551 --> 11:50.482
So, how long have
you two ladies
known each other?
那么，有多久了
你们两位女士
互相认识吗？

11:50.586 --> 11:51.620
What?
什么？

11:51.896 --> 11:52.896
What did he say?
他说什么？

12:07.793 --> 12:11.448
In a familiar restaurant
in a familiar part of town,
在熟悉的餐厅里
在小镇熟悉的地方，

12:11.551 --> 12:13.862
a call goes out in frustration.
沮丧地拨通了电话。

12:14.137 --> 12:15.931
Will you hurry up?!
你要快点吗？！

12:16.034 --> 12:18.068
A call that would
normally be answered
一个电话将
通常会得到答复

12:18.413 --> 12:20.448
by Bikini Bottom's
semiretired champions...
通过 比基尼泳裤
半退役冠军...

12:20.551 --> 12:23.862
If they weren't the ones
causing the problem.
如果他们不是那个人
导致问题。

12:24.137 --> 12:25.206
Now, let's see.
现在，让我们看看。

12:25.310 --> 12:27.655
I want a... no...
我想要一个……不……

12:27.896 --> 12:30.758
I want a... uh...
我想要一个……呃……

12:31.000 --> 12:33.034
Uh, no... uh... hmm.
呃，不……呃……嗯。

12:33.344 --> 12:35.275
Sir, will you please
order already?
先生，请您
已经订购了吗？

12:35.379 --> 12:37.517
You're holding up the line.
你正在排队。

12:37.620 --> 12:38.827
Uh...
呃...

12:38.931 --> 12:42.344
Psst... hey, Mermaidman,
get a Krabby Patty.
嘘……嘿，美人鱼，
买一份蟹肉饼。

12:42.448 --> 12:44.862
I've made my decision!
我已经做出决定了！

12:46.965 --> 12:48.448
One Krabby Patty for me
给我一份蟹肉饼

12:48.758 --> 12:50.862
and a Pip-squeak Patty
for the boy.
和一个吱吱作响的小馅饼
为了男孩。

12:51.137 --> 12:52.965
Now, wait just a darn minute.
现在，等一下。

12:55.344 --> 12:57.344
I don't want a Pip-squeak Patty!
我不想要吱吱作响的帕蒂！

12:57.448 --> 12:59.931
I want an adult-sized
Krabby Patty!
我想要一个成人尺寸的
蟹蟹帕蒂！

13:00.241 --> 13:02.655
The Krabby Patty
is too big for you.
蟹肉饼
对你来说太大了。

13:02.931 --> 13:04.448
You'll never finish it.
你永远不会完成它。

13:04.551 --> 13:06.172
Don't you see what you're doing?
你没看到你在做什么吗？

13:06.448 --> 13:08.137
You're treating me like a child!
你简直把我当小孩子了！

13:08.482 --> 13:10.275
The boy's eyes are bigger
than his stomach!
男孩的眼睛比较大
还不如他的胃呢！

13:12.241 --> 13:13.241
And that's another thing!
那是另一回事了！

13:13.344 --> 13:14.482
I'm not a boy!
我不是男孩！

13:14.586 --> 13:16.448
I'm so old I've got hairs
我已经老了，头发都长了

13:16.551 --> 13:18.586
growing out of the wrinkles
on my liver spots!
从皱纹中生长出来
在我的肝斑上！

13:20.379 --> 13:22.448
One Pip-squeak Patty...
一只吱吱作响的帕蒂……

13:22.724 --> 13:25.275
And your bib and high chair.
还有你的围兜和高脚椅。

13:27.724 --> 13:32.000
I'm 68 years old
and I want a Krabby Patty!
我今年68岁了
我想要一个蟹肉饼！

13:32.310 --> 13:34.275
Your Pip-squeak is getting cold.
你的吱吱声越来越冷了。

13:34.551 --> 13:35.862
Shall I feed you?
要我喂你吗？

13:36.103 --> 13:37.310
Feed this, old man!
老铁，喂这个！

13:37.413 --> 13:39.448
Ooh!
哦！

13:39.551 --> 13:41.896
I'm tired of playing
second banana
我玩累了
第二个香蕉

13:42.137 --> 13:43.793
to a man who wears a bra!
对于一个穿胸罩的男人！

13:43.896 --> 13:47.137
From now on, I want
to be called Barnacleman!
从现在开始，我要
被称为藤壶人！

13:47.482 --> 13:50.448
And I'm through with
protecting citizens
我已经结束了
保护公民

13:50.551 --> 13:51.965
that don't respect me!
那不尊重我！

13:52.241 --> 13:53.896
I respect you, Barnacleman!
我尊重你，藤壶人！

13:54.137 --> 13:56.758
That's Barnacleboy, I...!
那是Barnacleboy，我……！

13:57.034 --> 13:58.034
I mean man!
我是说男人！

13:58.172 --> 13:59.310
Oh...
哦...

13:59.413 --> 14:00.827
Forget you people.
忘记你们这些人。

14:00.931 --> 14:02.758
I say if you're not
going to give me
我说如果你不是
打算给我

14:03.034 --> 14:04.517
any respect as a hero,
作为英雄的任何尊重，

14:04.620 --> 14:07.551
then maybe you'll give me
respect as a villain.
那么也许你会给我
作为小人的尊重。

14:07.655 --> 14:11.551
A villain who is... evil.
一个……邪恶的恶棍。

14:11.827 --> 14:13.103
Evil?
邪恶的？

14:13.379 --> 14:14.586
Evil?
邪恶的？

14:16.172 --> 14:18.413
Evil!
邪恶的！

14:18.517 --> 14:22.655
I'm crossing over
to the dark side.
我穿越了
到黑暗的一面。

14:23.862 --> 14:26.482
I should waste money
lighting the whole store?
我应该浪费钱
照亮整个商店？

14:31.482 --> 14:33.379
Did someone say "evil"?
有人说“邪恶”吗？

14:33.482 --> 14:35.551
Holy oil spill!
圣油泄漏！

14:35.655 --> 14:38.034
It's Mermaidman
and Barnacleboy's
arch enemies,
这是美人鱼
和藤壶男孩的
宿敌，

14:38.137 --> 14:39.551
Man Ray and the Dirty Bubble!
曼雷和肮脏的泡泡！

14:39.827 --> 14:42.448
Nighty-night, you old goat!
晚安，你这个老山羊！

14:45.482 --> 14:47.137
Nighty-night.
晚安。

14:47.413 --> 14:49.275
Will you tuck me in?
你会把我塞进去吗？

14:49.379 --> 14:51.310
We interrupt
your bleak and meaningless lives
我们打断
你暗淡无意义的生活

14:51.551 --> 14:53.931
for this special news break.
为了这个特别的新闻报道。

14:54.206 --> 14:56.724
Man Ray...
曼·雷...

14:57.000 --> 14:58.896
the Dirty Bubble...
肮脏的泡泡...

15:01.241 --> 15:04.068
And now, playing for
the dark side, Barnacleboy...
而现在，为
黑暗面，藤壶男孩……

15:04.344 --> 15:06.551
Barnacleman!
藤壶人！

15:06.655 --> 15:09.448
Have been committing a series of
crimes throughout Bikini Bottom.
一直致力于一系列
比基尼底部的犯罪行为。

15:12.965 --> 15:14.275
Shh!
嘘！

15:16.586 --> 15:18.896
I'll get you crazy kids!
我会让你们这些疯狂的孩子们！

15:19.000 --> 15:20.720
These three have named
their new alliance...
这三人分别命名为
他们的新联盟...

15:24.758 --> 15:27.413
otherwise known as EVIL!
也称为邪恶！

15:27.689 --> 15:29.310
What can we do?
我们能做什么？

15:29.551 --> 15:31.586
When will this crime wave end?
这波犯罪浪潮何时结束？

15:31.689 --> 15:33.689
How will we defeat the EVIL?
我们将如何击败邪恶？

15:34.034 --> 15:37.206
Why am I asking you
all these questions?
我为什么问你
所有这些问题？

15:37.448 --> 15:40.689
Mermaidman, where are you?
美人鱼，你在哪里？

15:42.413 --> 15:43.413
I'm right here!
我就在这里！

15:43.758 --> 15:46.344
Don't worry, good citizens,
别担心，好公民，

15:46.689 --> 15:52.137
nothing will stop me
from defeating the EVIL!
没有什么能阻止我
战胜邪恶！

15:52.413 --> 15:54.379
Nothing!
没有什么！

15:56.310 --> 15:57.689
Ice cream?
冰淇淋？

15:58.379 --> 16:00.275
I love ice cream!
我喜欢冰淇淋！

16:00.724 --> 16:04.655
A double scoop of prune
with bran sprinkles.
双勺西梅
撒上麸皮。

16:04.758 --> 16:05.758
Mmm!
嗯！

16:11.103 --> 16:12.724
Goes right through me
every time.
直接穿过我
每次。

16:13.034 --> 16:15.344
You might as well
give up, Mermaidman.
你也可以
放弃吧，美人鱼。

16:15.689 --> 16:17.965
There's three of us
and only one of you.
我们有三个人
并且只有你们一个人。

16:18.206 --> 16:19.482
You don't stand a chance.
你没有机会。

16:21.172 --> 16:22.551
Are you okay, Mermaidman?
你还好吗，美人鱼？

16:22.862 --> 16:24.586
Oh, how are you going to beat
哦，你要怎么打败

16:24.689 --> 16:26.206
all three of those guys
by yourself?
所有这三个人
自己一个人吗？

16:26.482 --> 16:27.482
You're right.
你说得对。

16:27.517 --> 16:28.793
I give up.
我放弃。

16:29.103 --> 16:30.241
You can't give up.
你不能放弃。

16:30.517 --> 16:31.758
What if we help you?
如果我们帮助你怎么办？

16:32.000 --> 16:33.586
No, no, that's a terrible idea.
不，不，这是一个糟糕的主意。

16:33.689 --> 16:36.724
But what if you help me?
但如果你帮我怎么办？

16:36.827 --> 16:38.172
Okay.
好的。

16:38.275 --> 16:41.448
So, who wants to save the world?
那么，谁想拯救世界呢？

16:41.551 --> 16:42.620
I do!
我愿意！

16:42.862 --> 16:43.931
I do!
我愿意！

16:44.034 --> 16:45.068
I do!
我愿意！

16:45.172 --> 16:46.206
I don't.
我不知道。

16:46.482 --> 16:47.793
Oh, yes, you do.
哦，是的，你知道。

16:47.896 --> 16:49.551
No world means no money.
没有世界就意味着没有钱。

16:49.827 --> 16:52.241
Now, go save the world
or you're fired!
现在，去拯救世界吧
否则你就被解雇了！

16:54.413 --> 16:55.827
Then it's settled!
那么就这么定了！

16:56.103 --> 16:58.137
To the Mermalair!
前往美马拉尔！

16:58.862 --> 17:00.103
Wow!
哇！

17:00.379 --> 17:02.275
The Mermalair.
梅玛艾尔号。

17:02.379 --> 17:05.413
These costumes belonged
to the original
这些服装属于
到原来的

17:05.862 --> 17:09.103
International Justice League
of Super Acquaintances!
国际正义联盟
超级熟人！

17:09.517 --> 17:13.620
Wow! The I.J.L.S.A. were
the most heroic heroes ever!
哇！ I.J.L.S.A.是
有史以来最英勇的英雄！

17:13.724 --> 17:15.379
And you had
the best lunch box, too.
而你有
最好的午餐盒也是。

17:15.931 --> 17:17.724
Once you put on these costumes,
当你穿上这些服装后

17:18.103 --> 17:21.931
their fantastic powers
will become yours!
他们神奇的力量
将成为你的！

17:22.310 --> 17:25.689
Wow... I didn't think
super-powers worked that way.
哇……没想到
超能力就是这样运作的。

17:25.931 --> 17:27.241
Sure.
当然。

17:27.344 --> 17:28.965
Power's all in the costume.
力量全在服装里。

17:29.344 --> 17:31.689
Why else would we run around
in colored undies?
不然我们为什么要到处乱跑
穿着彩色内衣？

17:31.793 --> 17:34.379
I can think of
three good reasons.
我能想到
三个充分的理由。

17:34.655 --> 17:36.517
The Quickster...
快手...

17:36.862 --> 17:40.517
With the uncanny ability
to run really... quick!
凭借着不可思议的能力
跑得真……快！

17:40.620 --> 17:43.172
Want to see me run
to that mountain and back?
想看我奔跑
去那座山然后回来？

17:43.448 --> 17:45.241
You want to see me do it again?
你想看我再做一次吗？

17:45.517 --> 17:46.931
Captain Magma...
玛格玛船长...

17:47.275 --> 17:49.896
Get him angry
and he's bound to erupt!
让他生气
他一定会爆发！

17:50.172 --> 17:51.620
Krakatoa!
喀拉喀托！

17:56.000 --> 17:57.793
The Elastic Waistband...
松紧腰带...

17:58.241 --> 18:01.689
Able to stretch his body
into fantastic shapes and forms!
能够伸展身体
变成奇妙的形状和形式！

18:02.000 --> 18:05.620
I can finally touch my toes!
我终于可以触摸我的脚趾了！

18:05.724 --> 18:10.482
And Miss Appear...
Now you see her, now you don't!
还有出现小姐...
现在你看到她了，现在你看不到了！

18:10.827 --> 18:12.965
Does this outfit
make me look fat?
这身衣服有吗
让我看起来很胖？

18:13.482 --> 18:16.586
The International Justice League
of Super Acquaintances!
国际正义联盟
超级熟人！

18:16.689 --> 18:18.689
A subsidiary of Viacom.
维亚康姆的子公司。

18:19.655 --> 18:20.655
So, it's agreed...
所以，就这么约定了……

18:20.793 --> 18:22.413
We'll get one cheese pizza,
我们要一份芝士披萨

18:22.517 --> 18:25.482
one with pepperoni and
mushrooms, and one with olives.
一份配意大利辣香肠和
蘑菇，还有一种是橄榄。

18:25.827 --> 18:28.206
Super Acquaintances,
we need your help.
超级熟人，
我们需要你的帮助。

18:28.448 --> 18:30.000
Holy halibut... it's the Chief!
圣大比目鱼……是酋长！

18:30.344 --> 18:32.758
Thank you
for the introduction, Quickster,
谢谢你
对于介绍，Quickster，

18:32.862 --> 18:34.896
but we all know who Iam.
但我们都知道我是谁。

18:35.000 --> 18:39.034
More to the point, we've got
news on the whereabouts of EVIL.
更重要的是，我们有
有关 EIL 下落的消息。

18:39.310 --> 18:40.793
The whoseabouts of what?
谁的行踪是什么？

18:40.896 --> 18:43.172
You just tell us
where they are, Chief,
你只要告诉我们
他们在哪里，酋长，

18:43.275 --> 18:46.241
and we'll hog-tie them faster
than you can say "salsa verde."
我们会更快地把它们绑起来
比你可以说“萨尔萨佛得角”。

18:46.482 --> 18:48.068
Our sources last saw EVIL
我们的消息来源最后看到了邪恶

18:48.379 --> 18:50.586
harassing teenagers
up at Make-Out Reef.
骚扰青少年
到达Make-Out Reef。

18:50.896 --> 18:52.793
You know, Make-Out Reef.
你知道，亲热礁。

18:57.482 --> 18:59.448
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

18:59.793 --> 19:02.137
Floppin' flounder, Mermaidman...
Make-Out Reef!
扑通扑通的比目鱼，美人鱼……
亲热礁石！

19:02.413 --> 19:03.931
Those fiends!
那些恶魔！

19:04.034 --> 19:06.586
Attacking hormonally
stressed-out children!
荷尔蒙攻击
孩子压力大！

19:06.862 --> 19:08.724
Ahh... Make-Out Reef.
啊...亲热礁石。

19:08.827 --> 19:11.413
Good times, good times.
好时光，好时光。

19:11.655 --> 19:14.206
To Make-Out Reef!
前往亲吻礁！

19:14.448 --> 19:16.517
Away!
离开！

19:16.896 --> 19:19.137
Does this mean
we're not getting pizza?
这是否意味着
我们不吃披萨了吗？

19:21.551 --> 19:22.862
Stop it!
Leave us alone!
停下来！
别管我们了！

19:22.965 --> 19:25.206
Please, stop!
Please!
请停下来！
请！

19:25.310 --> 19:28.689
John and Nancy sitting
in a tree, K-I-S-S-I-N-G!
约翰和南希坐着
在树上，K-I-S-S-I-N-G！

19:29.034 --> 19:31.862
Oh, shine the flashlight
in that car, Man Ray!
哦，用手电筒照一下
在那辆车里，曼·雷！

19:33.413 --> 19:34.655
With pleasure.
荣幸。

19:36.448 --> 19:37.655
Hey, man, that's not cool.
嘿，伙计，这不酷。

19:40.000 --> 19:42.413
Leave those young lovers alone!
放过那些年轻的恋人吧！

19:42.758 --> 19:45.724
Well, if it isn't Milkmaid Man.
好吧，如果不是挤奶女工的话。

19:45.827 --> 19:47.517
You've saved us the trouble
你帮我们省去了麻烦

19:47.758 --> 19:48.758
of tracking you down.
追踪你。

19:49.034 --> 19:50.724
You fiends can't win!
你们这些恶魔是赢不了的！

19:50.827 --> 19:52.758
You're outnumbered!
你寡不敌众！

19:52.862 --> 19:54.758
You senile bag of fish paste!
你这老糊涂的鱼酱！

19:55.137 --> 19:58.689
There are three of us
and only one of you!
我们有三个人
而且只有你们一个人！

19:58.793 --> 20:00.689
Make that two!
做那两个！

20:00.793 --> 20:02.241
The Quickster!
快手！

20:05.103 --> 20:06.172
Three!
三！

20:06.448 --> 20:08.206
Captain Magma!
岩浆队长！

20:10.482 --> 20:11.482
Four!
四！

20:11.517 --> 20:12.517
The Elastic Waistband!
弹性腰带！

20:14.241 --> 20:15.827
Five!
五！

20:15.931 --> 20:17.172
M-M-Miss Appear?!
姆、姆、小姐出现？！

20:17.413 --> 20:20.931
And me makes ten, I think.
我想我赚了十个。

20:21.034 --> 20:22.448
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

20:22.551 --> 20:23.896
I don't feel so good about this.
我对此感觉不太好。

20:24.172 --> 20:26.586
Oh, there goes our toy deal.
哦，我们的玩具交易就这样结束了。

20:26.862 --> 20:32.103
Super Acquaintances, attack!
超级熟人，出击！

20:32.344 --> 20:33.344
Oh, no!
哦，不！

20:33.586 --> 20:34.586
Please, mercy!
求你怜悯！

20:34.724 --> 20:36.517
Krakatoa!
喀拉喀托！

20:41.000 --> 20:42.724
Get it off, get it off!
脱下来，脱下来！

20:43.034 --> 20:45.655
Get it off! Get it off!
Get it off!
把它脱下来！把它脱下来！
把它脱下来！

20:45.758 --> 20:47.241
I'll save you, Quickster!
我会救你的，快手！

20:47.517 --> 20:48.517
What...?
什么...？

20:50.137 --> 20:51.724
Whoa!
哇！

20:53.413 --> 20:55.206
Whoa...!
哇...！

20:59.137 --> 21:04.068
I'll cool you off, Quickster,
with one of my water balls!
我会让你冷静下来，Quickster，
用我的一个水球！

21:04.379 --> 21:05.448
Uh... ah...
呃……啊……

21:05.551 --> 21:07.310
Uh... ah... uh... ah...
呃……啊……呃……啊……

21:07.551 --> 21:08.551
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

21:08.689 --> 21:09.689
Huh?
啊？

21:09.793 --> 21:11.068
No-no, no-no!
不不不不不！

21:11.379 --> 21:12.448
I'm not the Quickster,
我不是快手

21:12.689 --> 21:13.758
I'm Captain Mag... ma.
我是麦格船长……妈妈。

21:16.137 --> 21:18.965
Well, I guess it's up to me.
好吧，我想这取决于我。

21:20.448 --> 21:23.689
I'll just sneak over, unseen,
and catch them by surprise.
我会偷偷溜过去，不被发现
让他们措手不及。

21:33.172 --> 21:34.413
Get it off!
把它脱下来！

21:34.689 --> 21:35.689
Get it off! Get it off!
把它脱下来！把它脱下来！

21:42.862 --> 21:43.965
Whew, glad that's over.
哇，很高兴一切都结束了。

21:50.896 --> 21:52.931
We... we did it, we won.
我们……我们做到了，我们赢了。

21:53.206 --> 21:56.482
This day belongs to EVIL!
这一天属于邪恶！

22:00.724 --> 22:02.586
You've lost, Mermaidman.
你输了，美人鱼。

22:02.931 --> 22:05.517
And the superhero-
super-villain rules say
还有超级英雄——
超级反派规则说

22:05.793 --> 22:08.862
you have to give in
to my demands.
你必须屈服
按照我的要求。

22:08.965 --> 22:11.379
Okay, what do you want?
好吧，你想要什么？

22:11.620 --> 22:13.034
World domination!
称霸世界！

22:13.137 --> 22:14.758
Tell him we want
world domination!
告诉他我们想要
统治世界！

22:15.034 --> 22:17.379
Oh, and make him eat dirt!
哦，让他吃土！

22:18.448 --> 22:20.344
In addition to the
domination thing.
除了
统治的事情。

22:20.724 --> 22:23.862
Number one: I want to be
treated like a superhero,
第一：我想成为
像超级英雄一样对待，

22:24.137 --> 22:25.931
not a sidekick.
不是配角。

22:26.034 --> 22:29.482
Number two: I want
to be called Barnacleman.
第二：我想要
被称为藤壶人。

22:29.724 --> 22:30.827
And number three...
还有第三...

22:30.931 --> 22:33.344
Come on, domination.
来吧，统治。

22:33.793 --> 22:35.862
I want an adult-sized
Krabby Patty.
我想要一个成人尺寸的
克拉比·帕蒂。

22:35.965 --> 22:37.482
Did you hear him say
你有没有听到他说

22:37.758 --> 22:38.838
anything about eating dirt?
吃土有什么关系吗？

22:39.000 --> 22:40.827
Need a hand?
需要帮忙吗？

22:40.931 --> 22:42.310
Super pal?
超级朋友？

22:49.103 --> 22:52.793
Good to have you
back on the side
of justice, Kyle.
很高兴有你
回到侧面
正义，凯尔。

22:53.103 --> 22:55.655
Let's go get you
that Krabby Patty.
我们去接你吧
那个蟹蟹帕蒂。

22:55.931 --> 22:57.482
Was that it?
是这样吗？

22:57.724 --> 22:58.965
I feel sick.
我觉得恶心。

22:59.068 --> 23:00.827
Oh, this reminds me of the time
哦，这让我想起了那个时候

23:01.172 --> 23:02.732
I went to Cancún with
the Killer Shrimp.
我和我一起去了坎昆
杀人虾。

23:02.896 --> 23:04.655
Oh, they had these
papaya drinks...
哦，他们有这些
木瓜饮料...

23:04.931 --> 23:07.137
Oh, Neptune, shut up!
哦，海王星，闭嘴！

23:09.344 --> 23:11.034
Mmm.
嗯。

23:11.137 --> 23:13.862
How's that adult-sized
Krabby Patty
成人尺寸怎么样
蟹肉饼

23:14.068 --> 23:15.310
treating you,
对待你，

23:15.551 --> 23:17.758
Barnacle... man?
藤壶……伙计？

23:18.000 --> 23:19.827
Actually, it's pretty big.
事实上，它相当大。

23:20.172 --> 23:22.517
I'm not sure I can
finish the whole thing.
我不确定我能不能
完成整个事情。

23:48.551 --> 23:50.172
And NICKELODEON
还有尼克罗迪恩

